      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "An E15 error code on your Bosch dishwasher usually indicates an issue with the water inlet system, like a blocked filter or a problem with the water supply itself. You should first check the water inlet hose for any kinks or blockages, and make sure the water supply valve behind the dishwasher is fully open. If those checks don't resolve it, you might need to inspect the inlet valve or the filter assembly for debris. If you're not comfortable doing this, calling a qualified appliance technician is the safest bet.",
